{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1323f1ce4bf72484ae348d12823a4f1156f7601ac42d40f28f203bdb24d9042f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bf2460743361b38e603347657ffc9cc0cad555d02a6aa33b2f7f152f3766629",
      "text": "启航，驶向名为偶像的汪洋",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46f368456c1c589448eb3c75a5c4ef9af94203b886a34aa840d111236820d16a",
      "text": "无法很好地向人们传达深爱的海洋的魅力，克里斯为此苦恼不已。就在这时，通过与制作人的相遇，他开始考虑将偶像这条道路，作为让大家对海洋产生兴趣的手段。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bf2460743361b38e603347657ffc9cc0cad555d02a6aa33b2f7f152f3766629",
      "text": "启航，驶向名为偶像的汪洋",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b64fe706e26f9ce834d8adb851fe8f462d0099a3741d1b04401c6b94c1f4dc",
      "text": "下次讲座要用的资料……\n记得，好像是收拾在这边了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5eae845056359bda1593f4e306573b930ab43a341cc310f63e03430ea720b3d",
      "text": "（……要把海洋的壮丽传达给学生们，\n还真是相当困难呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6051c3972570b7398646a694488f4fefc2dce63b1e2f002dd628ea5448a6f3e0",
      "text": "（哪怕在所有陆地都被踏遍的现代，\n海洋，也依然是未知的边疆）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316a68797e9c20132fc45376cde433df08e1fa0a513ac620a210eae7977ca32e",
      "text": "（深入了解那样的海洋，\n并将其魅力广泛传播给世人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8ecaca6bdda2e35d88d1da266a98e4cc74e35e5013f01264b23af7c4dde33b9",
      "text": "（怀着这样的想法，虽然成为了大学的教师……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4d024d99b7483d57ec9b13e6fd927e5fb400452ecd07ab7dcdf30d2c90cc2aa",
      "text": "（但今天的讲座也是空座显眼。\n学生们的评价，也不尽如人意）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad6b11483845f48d050a8285c82dfbcc07b14997b1ce9b0372d068ae11461e1",
      "text": "到底该怎么做，才能让大家\n产生兴趣呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc35b7f7e4c709d54a98b624dfadda85b7ea6511da4d377780c4e99bc157924b",
      "text": "……如果答案能轻易得出，就不必这么辛苦了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ae9943a9102bd647db39bdef9e5bd398931766fe4b42a3289f666f9eddb99a4",
      "text": "（这张研讨班招生的海报，\n虽然我觉得完成度不错）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:100fa9ad05cccf64951ffc2342a96187ebe132c11a4af56c5c7b7f57570a8d2b",
      "text": "（但究竟能起到多大效果呢。\n……还是不要抱太大期望比较好吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9c4dd76884e0a96e05d915426e8d55fd2e7429eeb87e83a5c6c2470f31eeb5",
      "text": "贴这边会比较显眼吗？\n不对，稍微再偏右一点吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a998b610ba1666998b46bcb16c23c977350cf739f90ea72b6f360ecd3b4469",
      "text": "……看到这张海报，\n试镜的报名者能增加就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a20059f8b375b78c6c07cb0ec878de7490e66756b454040e9c5e18d9b26ff583",
      "text": "昨天也收到了一份新的报名。\n名字记得好像是叫，北村想乐先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4e5bfa7d5dfa6cdfdfa905c2476a181d190d177bde641f9d7caec81183c09de",
      "text": "照这个势头，继续寻找未来的偶像吧。\n好，最后再贴一张……哎呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0fc6807cfa6faa5122a9e291ad63189e219283a18fadac88e9343a138039389",
      "text": "非常抱歉。\n打扰到您的工作了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36d0ae81895ea409bb82c64b4a1c453c2caa84ec994c722dde7dec77d673a4a6",
      "text": "哪里，我才是！……啊，您也要\n贴海报吧。请用，贴在这里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c04c3e7f35cacffac6a523eec0d02c2578e38b7b8b203ee43544cfaab8b700ff",
      "text": "不，没关系的。\n这里还有空余的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72905ab4e960a79f2708c13018da9f845b7776892b9dfb23f3fe47a9143eebba",
      "text": "而且……自己的研讨班就算贴在显眼的地方，\n也不会有什么效果吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b01037e65ceb889af7b7f3b15caa839a85e8064e28d6d305df6df1d8ba391fdd",
      "text": "研讨班……\n莫非，您是这所大学的老师吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208b5c456a21eee431842295ec8af1dd0fb9d49fa37f3aa92e2b3dd2e708e53d",
      "text": "是的，我是助理教授。\n名叫古论克里斯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2bc254e3fb15f955dbab94f3ac666e8659c6ab72e1c584d48d1d51c7c8ebc5",
      "text": "原来是助理教授啊。那更应该\n使用这边的空间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa676b385c5eed0e14bb030f0d4ead97ab98164abd581ec0261c11f4aa98e8b4",
      "text": "我并不是这所大学的人。\n只是今天来打扰一下的外人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e0f917206b16fa9e6df2214242537ae970d2a2f92708db0b23f76fcc913b739",
      "text": "可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b62c33e00e971d4fbae6b5f4fdfe2de3ac647729869b560b6c0c8bf57ca41aee",
      "text": "……我明白了。非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9794015d64fe55d7c281ec01214a51128e041b5dd7ebe72a253fef5a89321ef9",
      "text": "那么，我就恭敬不如从命了。\n……希望能借此多来几位参与者。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46cf18b87c8e3a2cd7c43f3eedc5120d76f0e930179160af2fa528cdfb8b7662",
      "text": "哇，海报上印着的这片海，真漂亮啊。\n难道说，您很喜欢大海吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25122fff851d1c3ed27325feec41b7c22fad197a72197e4224b08ada531a573a",
      "text": "……！是的，正如您所言！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe396d5ca4257ec7547fbfc8d971ee7b4c00e811acc95db545f22742c6d050b3",
      "text": "就算说海洋是我人生的全部，\n也毫不为过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91ccb321a65dacfe1f30bf82c4f42831ca1aac6c4bb99b3b427963b2dc81e62c",
      "text": "仅仅看了一眼这张照片，就察觉到了我灵魂的故乡——\n西班牙海域的壮美……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9b78c62867756eb7cfd9fc41a4c5abbc89128c7870ab69dd1b64e1f53a2b96e",
      "text": "太棒了。您能够理解呢，\n我对海洋的情感……以及，海洋的魅力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6eeb50a5fd31280d5d28e71cc1557d2515abae320c4174461b31c0fe17ff5be",
      "text": "据说，海洋占据了整个地球的\n大约百分之七十。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bc4a77e1192888759db5a3f39a91823e76ab39efff7694932d9ec640239491d",
      "text": "百分之七十……\n重新听数字说出来，真是惊人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8672cf6455d577eea14287ce0b555fcd7759c73b29f8567feec0f9962172f90",
      "text": "但是，令人吃惊的还在后头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7122da6666caef6cd1393a0394f87f72dd0a40349499052e20f15501302bfd1",
      "text": "虽说海洋占据了地球的大部分，\n但其实还可以按“深度”来进一步划分。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1210aa38e44e61753636a9336e2de1409c4db5720d05fce90d5b86ba80fb887d",
      "text": "比水深200米更深的地方。\n也就是俗称的“深海”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a558a08238a04a25ae8b48580edc0331fdfd6f8ed1f6f55fa83c7aad35ead00",
      "text": "这里居然，占据了整个海洋的\n大约百分之九十五！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26360e000ee5bee9bd44fe5584384274abcc0906354ab9094016a96b9006ac9d",
      "text": "百分之九十五……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de9b601577088588eea6ccbf55c90436a94e68e04a7b989e4de7881942e53a46",
      "text": "深海无比辽阔。不仅如此，\n大部分都是尚未被探明的区域。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3cb859aa74cf7dc973fbaee5143af1cab37f038a9c6dfe02aaeff1a488b3362",
      "text": "如此未知的领域，至今仍然存在着。\n光是想象一下，就让人心潮澎湃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5865d1b3b4a01a97738a57c14db4313e123324be6d76dd4fe7bde513c3cc61d0",
      "text": "为了传达这般海洋的魅力，\n我才在这里担任海洋学的助理教授。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7416ec5662d6767c2916454e2c06657d78cbddd5e116133c6abdaff795f02a7e",
      "text": "啊……对、对不起。\n我是不是自顾自说得太多了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f88c3c1fb6ed505123fe1eec480d75665680179efc715c1e29c3f379517e4bd",
      "text": "（多么富有热情的人啊！\n如果是这个人的话，说不定……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8dc195b3a973c7e3fc172d7044e3a97de67b0d8feaf28e2660e64b6992b8493",
      "text": "……但是这件事情，也很难\n进展得很顺利呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f24cef61684806c01e8744d29253761e84c7108c9ac9a0ff3c434b8ef087dff4",
      "text": "是这样吗？\n明明是这么有趣的话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85bb825b3be4c2f8afca5fc7085d5cb06fa1cb924da997e0b5b5219b8e82f58f",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n只是，问题不在于海洋，而在于我自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c98bb2e47007e3294daf80d3971ec99a6ff9f9f887c5e5c851d7921f4c9a7f2",
      "text": "也就是说，我这个人，\n很不擅长与他人沟通……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8a2f0491135113fc51cc449048db8033d08fe5cd1ee6902b1596ed3c86da10b",
      "text": "虽说因为对大海的热爱，\n最终走到了今天这份工作，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08d085f37b5d884978384c7e589bc3fd8d35e0977cf767f15adb664c609f097e",
      "text": "但本就不擅长言辞，\n连深爱的大海的魅力都无法传达……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec1fafd89fa1f9d244d5d5ac77d12a16f5fba587fe03d5fbfb9a735bf2421088",
      "text": "即使如此也无论如何希望能引起大家的兴趣，\n这才制作了这张海报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba79ecb7bb296fca94ef29736acacf34bb487cac3118180317979d1965bf3777",
      "text": "原来是这样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38dcfe88c42b0f155952d137fb5c1f441e73e2c878495491f59bb82636843726",
      "text": "所以，您能对此产生兴趣，\n我感到非常高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef58cd46f6270dcee99f46659f4e5d26a862d1c4d44fed8898224591bdd06965",
      "text": "能这么愉快地交谈，已经很久没有过了。\n请务必让我向您道谢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9643c472913fa1ebb5de6182710aa731374bd30d6b3f0db9151ab86cb62c20a",
      "text": "……这边这边！\n看啊，好像是偶像的试镜哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bad30f3897171ec5e9ac2de65f1252aac63cd532dc72c9d14cb0a12e736af530",
      "text": "……哎呀？\n不知为何人开始聚集起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfacd3c5655e74e5318a6ae5d49edbf5e1c7f863477cca0fa78a62c67e000eb",
      "text": "嘿～是新人偶像的招募呢！\n你要不要去试试看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed3aa7aac056b8fe3ad1420e9e8de5ba08d52b9f71f78c0c0ae1f64e3dae9c6a",
      "text": "别闹了，我怎么可能当偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5acfcd79895b736fa0cafd9b48cab4fcb32530a7d47851ec9f2413db6e666cc3",
      "text": "难以置信。学生们居然被您张贴的海报\n给吸引得目不转睛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cd0448a198e2afd0cdbdbb36f468117fbdebaa5fae465156ee0a75aeb9f61ee",
      "text": "太好了。说实话，我还担心万一\n根本没人看该怎么办呢……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f278c4ed33cd4e755cba9047cb43ec5de9b73e6c5b79b85fed48c12ed810bf",
      "text": "呵呵。\n……话说回来，偶像，是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2250a9004b4d30ec849204ac01699d1e480f4f2dcda338bdd8cb449d7977efcd",
      "text": "啊，不好意思。\n我还没做自我介绍呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdc61933939253ad079636f56d24e12d6136c191e39a7e8c6a6369016822df9c",
      "text": "其实我是一家名叫315 Production的\n偶像事务所的制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4d4b482e8d8041c398fa26b143a901af0281903a46e4991f88d6d5845e80715",
      "text": "这一次，为了招募事务所的新偶像，\n才在这所大学里张贴举办试镜的海报……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f5805418f67d4101754a113278382ba6a5460d934d039653d36ac4cb4979b25",
      "text": "诶，偶像的制作人！？\n难道说，就是所谓的业界人士吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334e2665190c5b6d32ce28486c4b79f6e040cdda9903f0c226cc78195eac4462",
      "text": "是、是的。\n按理说，是这样的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df9f373a5e306631facf2e58ba2618b15c439106f111d25d512f9e83a940dcb0",
      "text": "好厉害！那您，\n见过偶像和真君吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d64b4f0ac786f9014d84200431425f7ba1ecacc333a32c87db4bd730f2e0a30",
      "text": "之前在工作现场偶遇过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41e63f7e58fcce9d5352a3bcd484d6b1bfcdec869ac38cee994e9f5f3845d73a",
      "text": "诶，好羡慕！我是他的粉丝啊！\n那前阵子出道的莎拉酱之类的呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2ee5f8c6077194f868bb40d1c12587939d4e841ea067a59815f736e1407fed1",
      "text": "终、终于被放行了。\n不好意思，刚才明明话说到一半……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d650dd7e5f06265fe40934389a4a3c699b5c6b675aceba30ab9d4694578b50a",
      "text": "……太棒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b29f0f2fad3d7922ea3f365e101aeb3e9025e5bd77f272fd27049bb546e384b",
      "text": "学生们，竟然会那么热切地\n想要打听消息……真的，太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68447efcc9a7db4d9746588384ee672a35a68affc680961ead2348f4704ff4e1",
      "text": "偶像这种存在，竟然能如此\n吸引人们的兴趣吗……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:586bc5b9aef45d4aea3e92fe5823be62650ae5701aa3e42b925729aad06dc197",
      "text": "我还是头一次看到学生们那么热心，\n不断抛出问题的景象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20b701ef2a8cfbfdc658fe743058d30118f75b661f3e88d69af3dde4df90a14e",
      "text": "如果我也成为偶像的话，是不是也一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9900eee5cf39d764c2fbffd3c750e96dece681e50bd5a731cac472d0370674d9",
      "text": "能让大家对大海的话题，产生兴趣呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e492c4e85fefc5b8c51358eeb07811d3d7a8b85dbb9baf18b0ca474f35be25",
      "text": "……！是的！\n只要有热情，我认为一定能够实现的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60b80901144d465b73e856d9be450a951ba0261f07d8f0cd6fb5cd9f2ed4579",
      "text": "如果不介意的话，请收下这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:047e19f211d9c92a6aed0e8b1a7ca06737663e568d026fd072ec8ab4b37d5e99",
      "text": "这是，名片……吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5497ff2f2f84f2460d577b84d24126bfe548c1ac8f6168cabe6ff50d42df03e5",
      "text": "是的。如果您有了兴趣，\n请务必来参加试镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50ea684d0a611b81305e2b48f918101928244e61a9885eac4a00197a5f9eed18",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该告辞了。\n今天真的非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3f905952c011a8d1a03cafbe6a36293a2c87167a72a7b04cf803193980f38d4",
      "text": "315 Production……偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f249c83fb5064b3db3ca648b19787e0e1ecbb6ac5d0fac64357576b723b47f9",
      "text": "正当我在大学这片陆地上，\n快要溺水之时……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5094b2dcb0d211d4a52b49eb77673772931280108aa984c218842adff28a492a",
      "text": "没想到，竟然能遇上这样的机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4812bb57176b68ff71ac9261ccf2964f32050c8e7028e6a25f7197bf24d9b7c",
      "text": "（说实话，虽然我并不明白\n偶像究竟是怎样的事物）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82bfd9b937345031a8412c112b5232351231dff9c183d5552d000bf29313d90d",
      "text": "（但跳入未知世界的乐趣，\n我想自己比谁都清楚。……而且）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d023df6a9840d8624cc3bdb21f650cd09865274231feaeee4caddf2a034c8231",
      "text": "（我的心，已经为了这份新的发现而欢腾雀跃了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95b0502913b981bbceffb5598b5c4236f9f062bc75850fbda4faf73f9ce202bb",
      "text": "最重要的是，学生们的那个眼神。\n那正是我一直在寻觅的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e7ebb2ae3b67bfc309e44d99728e6f902c29ce7cfbd322e0080c9301dbfff9",
      "text": "成为偶像的话，一定能让大家对我、\n对我所说的话产生兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1b71e4822878c4f622c2fc8c29e810c5ad40aeffdfc0e0e11d05d9bf9beaf0",
      "text": "就能将大海的魅力，传达给更多的人……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9bf5bd181abe69829dc9fd801ff6643a2e59eba438791b4ef7c788754eef61e",
      "text": "可不能再这样呆坐下去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f392afb7960e126f8d93a7ae1c13ba1c503a6e18c999461269c3e7a1c83bb2c2",
      "text": "来吧，向着名为偶像的大海起航吧。\n崭新的冒险，正在等待着我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47ee31862619acc3c36659ff67c8084a884f9f73f90771f8050d29ad67618d38",
      "text": "……好。这样一来，\n今天的预定就全部结束了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13cdf07f80f49c39fbf1d0da19f710b0d09353377f7b571d7442f83ea70f1209",
      "text": "（中午遇到的那位大学老师，\n要是能来参加试镜就好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a4c1081ce9fbe70da4684b0a9fc645dad04f9b6afea98e8727b6dc6c04d62e6",
      "text": "（咦……是有点累了吗？\n突然有点头晕……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66700e75a6755b0dc1028bce83272833f06cbe90d8a8a94cdd1d9ac0f805293f",
      "text": "哎哟。\n没事吧？这位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316317fb7abf2fc50fbe437c0568b998f9edbbab6fff31d1d8c2ef8e9da9499d",
      "text": "……诶？啊，\n谢谢您扶住我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f2f2a53f9343ef6952ef0a183dae04b0e29d7aeee79f9e7cf295689ba0389d",
      "text": "那倒无所谓。\n……话虽如此，这还真是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edfba8f1dae17469a2eb2d89913cc6de5dbe64653cdc8227123499199fe79f73",
      "text": "诶？有什么……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a18e1d21cab6b562dc27423ac5f631bab22959910168ae70fe3b3ca77e4095c",
      "text": "不，没什么。\n比起这个，你来这栋大楼是有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf0c81264c3b7957567cf1c6cc609030e5b33422c5b250afc928744de0ff5b0a",
      "text": "虽然多管闲事了点……\n不过我觉得现在还是别靠近这里为好哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0356824e357893500f672496b457d089b83f1e738289bfcfe5e82908248526a6",
      "text": "我是偶像事务所的人。\n刚才在这边办完了事情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
